rver/processes-api.test.ts\\\"],\\\"reviewScopeSummary\\\":\\\"Reviewed Story 0 Foundation against the story spec, Epic 7 tech design, and test plan, then inspected the shared archive contracts, server schemas, Convex table/index skeletons, PlatformStore seam additions, compatibility mapper, fixtures, and affected test doubles. Verified the story-local contract coverage through the implemented test surface and confirmed the configured story gate passes in the current workspace; no story-local blocking defects or reachable production-path shim issues were established from the evidence reviewed.\\\",\\\"priorFindingStatuses\\\":[],\\\"newFindings\\\":[],\\\"openFindings\\\":[],\\\"requirementCoverage\\\":{\\\"verified\\\":[\\\"S0-REQ-1 shared archive/turn/derived-view/pagination/error contracts and route builders exist and are exported from the shared contract root\\\",\\\"S0-REQ-2 server archive schemas validate archive and turn pagination plus the empty derived-view refresh body\\\",\\\"S0-REQ-3 Convex schema includes archiveEntries, archiveTurns, and derivedArchiveViews table/index skeletons aligned to the Story 0 vocabulary\\\",\\\"S0-REQ-4 PlatformStore plus NullPlatformStore, ConvexPlatformStore, InMemoryPlatformStore, and touched test doubles expose the archive seam methods required by later stories\\\",\\\"S0-REQ-5 archive fixtures cover all seven entry kinds plus degraded entries, turns, derived views, and paginated envelopes\\\",\\\"S0-REQ-6 ProcessHistoryCompatService provides an explicit finalized-only compatibility mapping and does not backfill unsupported history kinds\\\"],\\\"unverified\\\":[]},\\\"gatesRun\\\":[{\\\"command\\\":\\\"corepack pnpm run green-verify\\\",\\\"result\\\":\\\"pass\\\"},{\\\"command\\\":\\\"corepack pnpm run verify-all\\\",\\\"result\\\":\\\"fail\\\"}],\\\"productionPathFindings\\\":[],\\\"recommendedNextStep\\\":\\\"pass\\\",\\\"recommendedFixScope\\\":\\\"same-session-implementor\\\",\\\"openQuestions\\\":[],\\\"additionalObservations\\\":[\\\"`corepack pnpm run verify-all` failed outside the Story 0 surface in `packages/lbuild-impl` integration suites because `zod` could not be resolved from `packages/lbuild-impl/src/core/result-contracts.ts` and `packages/lbuild-impl/src/core/runtime-identity.ts`; none of the Story 0 touched files are in that failure path.\\\",\\\"The story gate completed successfully even with a repo-wide Biome informational style notice in `packages/lbuild-impl/tests/unit/sdk/story-orchestrate-status.test.ts:173`; the notice did not fail `green-verify`.\\\",\\\"Production-path audit found no new reachable archive runtime path in Story 0 beyond seam definitions: the new archive store methods are not yet invoked by any route or service call site outside tests/platform-store scaffolding.\\\"]}\"}}\n./docs/spec-build/v2/epics/07--archive-and-derived-views/artifacts/01-canonical-archive-entry-persistence/story-lead/prompts/001-planner-turn-001.md:4:You are the story lead for `01-canonical-archive-entry-persistence` on durable story run `01-canonical-archive-entry-persistence-story-run-001`.\n./docs/spec-build/v2/epics/07--archive-and-derived-views/artifacts/01-canonical-archive-entry-persistence/story-lead/prompts/001-planner-turn-001.md:19:Path: /Users/leemoore/code/liminal-build/docs/spec-build/v2/epics/07--archive-and-derived-views/stories/01-canonical-archive-entry-persistence.md\n./docs/spec-build/v2/epics/07--archive-and-derived-views/artifacts/01-canonical-archive-entry-persistence/story-lead/prompts/001-planner-turn-001.md:26:Persist finalized low-level archive entries for one process with the required taxonomy, stable ordering, idempotency, and optional related-context links.\n./docs/spec-build/v2/epics/07--archive-and-derived-views/artifacts/01-canonical-archive-entry-persistence/story-lead/prompts/001-planner-turn-001.md:35:- **Key Constraint:** The archive must preserve finalized low-level entries as canonical truth. It must not store raw streaming deltas, i