73a-19e600231531\",\"continuation\":{\"provider\":\"codex\",\"sessionId\":\"019df617-f545-7c12-973a-19e600231531\",\"storyId\":\"01-canonical-archive-entry-persistence\"},\"mode\":\"followup\",\"story\":{\"id\":\"01-canonical-archive-entry-persistence\",\"title\":\"Story 1: Canonical Archive Entry Persistence\"},\"artifactsRead\":[\"docs/spec-build/v2/epics/07--archive-and-derived-views/stories/01-canonical-archive-entry-persistence.md\",\"docs/spec-build/v2/epics/07--archive-and-derived-views/tech-design.md\",\"docs/spec-build/v2/epics/07--archive-and-derived-views/test-plan.md\",\"convex/archiveEntries.ts\",\"convex/archiveEntries.test.ts\"],\"reviewScopeSummary\":\"Follow-up convergence under impl-lead ruling 012: rechecked the updated Story 1 scope/mapping docs against the current `convex/archiveEntries` and `convex/archiveEntries.test.ts` surfaces, then reran the targeted Story 1 test and the configured story gate to validate current readiness.\",\"priorFindingStatuses\":[{\"id\":\"S1-F1\",\"status\":\"resolved\",\"rationale\":\"Impl-lead ruling 012 and the updated story/test-plan/tech-design text now consistently judge Story 1 on the primitive append/read boundary only. The story now rewrites AC-1.1 and AC-1.4 to primitive-level behavior and maps TC-1.1a/b/c and TC-1.4a/b to `convex/archiveEntries.test.ts` (`docs/spec-build/v2/epics/07--archive-and-derived-views/stories/01-canonical-archive-entry-persistence.md:51-97`, `156-178`; `docs/spec-build/v2/epics/07--archive-and-derived-views/test-plan.md:44-54`; `docs/spec-build/v2/epics/07--archive-and-derived-views/tech-design.md:563-569`). The prior scope dispute is closed.\"},{\"id\":\"S1-F2\",\"status\":\"resolved\",\"rationale\":\"The prior `collect()`-then-slice observation no longer applies because the cited `listArchiveEntries` implementation is not present in the current `convex/archiveEntries.ts`. That concern is superseded by the new blocking regression below: the Story 1 append/read primitive exports are now absent entirely.\"}],\"newFindings\":[{\"id\":\"S1-F3\",\"severity\":\"major\",\"title\":\"The current archiveEntries module no longer exports the Story 1 append/read primitive, and the story gate now fails\",\"evidence\":\"`convex/archiveEntries.ts` currently contains only validators and `archiveEntriesTableFields` (`convex/archiveEntries.ts:1-45`); it does not export `appendArchiveEntry` or `listArchiveEntries`. `convex/archiveEntries.test.ts` still imports those symbols at `convex/archiveEntries.test.ts:1-3`, so the targeted Story 1 test now fails immediately with `_handler` undefined, and `corepack pnpm run green-verify` fails in typecheck with `TS2305: Module './archiveEntries.js' has no exported member 'appendArchiveEntry'` and `listArchiveEntries`. A repo search over `convex` and `apps/platform` found no replacement mutation/query export for these primitive functions. This removes the executable Story 1 persistence surface and breaks the configured story gate.\",\"affectedFiles\":[\"convex/archiveEntries.ts\",\"convex/archiveEntries.test.ts\"],\"requirementIds\":[\"AC-1.1\",\"TC-1.1a\",\"TC-1.1b\",\"TC-1.1c\",\"AC-1.2\",\"TC-1.2a\",\"TC-1.2b\",\"AC-1.3\",\"TC-1.3a\",\"TC-1.3b\",\"AC-1.4\",\"TC-1.4a\",\"TC-1.4b\"],\"recommendedFixScope\":\"same-session-implementor\",\"blocking\":true}],\"openFindings\":[{\"id\":\"S1-F3\",\"severity\":\"major\",\"title\":\"The current archiveEntries module no longer exports the Story 1 append/read primitive, and the story gate now fails\",\"evidence\":\"`convex/archiveEntries.ts` currently contains only validators and `archiveEntriesTableFields` (`convex/archiveEntries.ts:1-45`); it does not export `appendArchiveEntry` or `listArchiveEntries`. `convex/archiveEntries.test.ts` still imports those symbols at `convex/archiveEntries.test.ts:1-3`, so the targeted Story 1 test now fails immediately with `_handler` undefined, and `corepack pnpm run green-verify` fails in typecheck with `TS2305: Module './archiveEntries.js' has no exported member 'appendArchiveEntry'` and `listArchiveEntries`. A repo search over `convex` and `apps/platform` found no replacement mutation/query export for these primitive functions. This removes the executable Story 1 persistence surface and breaks the configured story gate.\",\"affectedFiles\":[\"convex/archiveEntries.ts\",\"convex/archiveEntries.test.ts\"],\"requirementIds\":[\"AC-1.1\",\"TC-1.1a\",\"TC-1.1b\",\"TC-1.1c\",\"AC-1.2\",\"TC-1.2a\",\"TC-1.2b\",\"AC-1.3\",\"TC-1.3a\",\"TC-1.3b\",\"AC-1.4\",\"TC-1.4a\",\"TC-1.4b\"],\"recommendedFixScope\":\"same-session-implementor\",\"blocking\":true}],\"requirementCoverage\":{\"verified\":[],\"unverified\":[\"AC-1.1\",\"TC-1.1a\",\"TC-1.1b\",\"TC-1.1c\",\"AC-1.2\",\"TC-1.2a\",\"TC-1.2b\",\"AC-1.3\",\"TC-1.3a\",\"TC-1.3b\",\"AC-1.4\",\"TC-1.4a\",\"TC-1.4b\"]},\"gatesRun\":[{\"command\":\"corepack pnpm exec vitest run convex/archiveEntries.test.ts --environment node\",\"result\":\"fail\"},{\"command\":\"corepack pnpm run green-verify\",\"result\":\"fail\"},{\"command\":\"corepack pnpm run verify-all\",\"result\":\"not-run\"}],\"productionPathFindings\":[\"`convex/archiveEntries.ts` no longer provides the real Story 1 runtime path for archive entry append/read; only schema validators remain, so the production primitive itself is missing.\"],\"recommendedNextStep\":\"revise\",\"recommendedFixScope\":\"same-session-implementor\",\"openQuestions\":[],\"additionalObservations\":[\"The earlier human-ruling blocker is closed: the story, tech design, and test plan now consistently scope Story 1 to primitive append/read behavior only.\",\"No fake adapter, shim, or placeholder execution branch was found in the current runtime surface; the blocking issue is that the runtime primitive exports are absent, not that a fake path replaced them.\"]},\"errors\":[],\"warnings\":[],\"artifacts\":[{\"kind\":\"result-envelope\",\"path\":\"/Users/leemoore/code/liminal-build/docs/spec-build/v2/epics/07--archive-and-derived-views/artifacts/0